1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,021
You are a seagull.

2
00:00:03,172 --> 00:00:05,194
You are hungry.

3
00:00:05,344 --> 00:00:08,541
That is, mostly, the entire plot.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,022
Meet the big brother on the cafe roof.

5
00:00:12,172 --> 00:00:15,346
He has the hat, the coat, the shades.

6
00:00:15,495 --> 00:00:17,517
So why does he look so hungry?

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,789
Down below, a man is holding a fresh carton of fries.

8
00:00:22,939 --> 00:00:25,393
You have wings. He does not.

9
00:00:25,543 --> 00:00:27,565
Seems fair.

10
00:00:28,365 --> 00:00:32,908
Fly fast at a fry, and the grab turns into a little rhythm game.

11
00:00:33,057 --> 00:00:37,624
Rings close in around the fry. Hit the green as each one lands.

12
00:00:37,774 --> 00:00:39,292
Gold counts double.

13
00:00:44,365 --> 00:00:47,371
Three fries in, you unlock Gull Sight.

14
00:00:47,521 --> 00:00:51,391
Time slows down, and the fries worth chasing light up.

15
00:00:52,365 --> 00:00:56,835
Seven colours of magic fry, and each one changes how you fly.

16
00:00:56,986 --> 00:00:59,752
Faster. Calmer. Tougher.

17
00:01:02,365 --> 00:01:07,676
Fries hide everywhere. Pool decks. Barbecues. Rooftop terraces.

18
00:01:07,826 --> 00:01:10,232
So fly low, and look around.

19
00:01:10,932 --> 00:01:14,898
Steal a hat, a cocktail, even somebody's socks.

20
00:01:15,048 --> 00:01:18,894
The Fry Codex keeps track of every silly thing you wear.

21
00:01:19,594 --> 00:01:22,120
Gold fries need three targets.

22
00:01:22,270 --> 00:01:26,356
Diamond ones need five, arranged like the Olympic rings.

23
00:01:26,506 --> 00:01:28,528
Good luck.

24
00:01:29,594 --> 00:01:31,616
There are quests, too.

25
00:01:31,766 --> 00:01:34,220
Catch a fish. Catch a cloud.

26
00:01:34,370 --> 00:01:36,392
Catch the sun.

27
00:01:37,694 --> 00:01:43,004
Collect every magic fry in town, and you will be the fastest gull alive.

28
00:01:43,154 --> 00:01:45,920
And somehow... you will still be hungry.

29
00:01:46,070 --> 00:01:49,076
Why? That part, we will not spoil.

